# The .strings files under Mac/Resources/*.lproj are generated from the .po
# sources, but the generator cannot be relied on: it skips a locale whenever
# the target is not older than the source, which is always true right after a
# checkout. Xcode rejects missing build inputs, so a clean checkout could not
# build. They are committed instead.
Resources/locale
